/**
 * One line in a {@link FailureMode}.
 *
 * In rule-based failure mode recommendation, represents one way in which the parent
 * {@link FailureMode} can be diagnosed by specifying a {@link ExpectedSensor} and a
 * {@link FailureModeDiagnostic} which together are representative of the parent
 * {@link FailureMode}.
 *
 * In ML-based failure mode, this type is simply a wrapper for an expected sensor which is relevant
 * to the parent failure mode and can be used as a feature in training models for the failure mode.
 */

remix type FailureModeLineItem mixes AssetOnboardingImportTracking
